One important takeaway

            Don't think:            
                    "The stack stores heights that might produce the maximum area."
            
            Think:            
                "The stack stores unresolved bars whose right boundary has not yet been found."
            
            Once a smaller bar arrives:

                        smaller bar
                             ↓
                        right boundary discovered
                             ↓
                        pop taller bar
                             ↓
                        stack top gives left boundary
                             ↓
                        calculate maximum possible rectangle for that bar

